\subsection{Computational Complexity Analysis}

In addition to the classification performance, the computational efficiency of the proposed model was evaluated. Table~\ref{tab:complexity} summarises the complexity in terms of the parameter count, estimated multiply-accumulate operations (MACs), inference latency per sample, throughput (samples per second), energy consumption proxy, and training time.

