\subsection{Cross-Dataset Generalization}
To evaluate model robustness and capability to generalise to unseen networks, cross-dataset experiments were conducted. The model was trained on one dataset and evaluated on the test splits of the other three. The results are summarised in Table~\ref{tab:cross_dataset}.

\begin{table*}[h]
\centering
